    <!-- Vault section, issue #32 -->
    <!-- Hidden vault (ADR-0017): media sealed in an app-private store under an
         AndroidKeyStore key, listed only after a PIN unlock, auto-locked when
         the app goes to the background. Everything is on-device only; the app
         holds no INTERNET permission, so no vault byte can ever leave the
         device. -->
